// Ch13: the wedding's red thread. After the heresy, the spool she kept.
title: ch13_bark_seamstress
location: ch13/ansedra
---
<<if $ch14_declared_heretics>>
    Townsfolk as "Seamstress" [sad]: They took the red thread down. I kept a spool. I don't know why I'm telling you. #line:ch13_bark_seam_001
<<elseif $ch13_wedding_announced>>
    Townsfolk as "Seamstress" [smile]: Red thread for a Cantor's wedding. I haven't slept. I don't mind. #line:ch13_bark_seam_002
<<else>>
    Townsfolk as "Seamstress" [neutral]: Red for weddings, white for the Order, and nothing for anything else. #line:ch13_bark_seam_003
<<endif>>
===
